abstract: "Research data accompanying a manuscript prepared for the Journal of Molecular Graphics and Modelling. Molecular and periodic DFT examine proton transfer in SAPH; docking and molecular dynamics examine sulfanilamide binding to carbonic anhydrase II. The dataset license covers original data; original code is MIT licensed and third-party rights are retained."
